# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day34

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| manufacture | 제조하다 | The company manufactures electronic devices. |
| distribute | 배포하다, 유통하다 | The products are distributed worldwide. |
| purchase | 구매하다 | Customers can purchase the product online. |
| replace | 교체하다 | We need to replace the old equipment. |
| equipment | 장비 | The laboratory has modern equipment. |

